
# Local build settings holding the Azure Storage credentials. See SECURITY.md.
*.xcconfig

# Per-user Xcode state, and the reason it matters here: a scheme's environment
# variables are stored inside xcuserdata/<user>.xcuserdatad/xcschemes/*.xcscheme
# in plain text. SECURITY.md tells you to put the account key there, so leaving
# these tracked would hand the key straight back to git on the next commit.
xcuserdata/
